WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.185 --> 00:00:11.925
In tutorial 11.10, you'll keep your own
sign-in up to date: your name, your e-mail,

00:00:11.975 --> 00:00:14.079
your password and your Google sign-in.

00:00:15.109 --> 00:00:18.824
First, click your name at the bottom
of the menu, and choose Your account.

00:00:20.584 --> 00:00:24.333
Under Profile, type the name your
team should see, and click Save.

00:00:26.113 --> 00:00:28.498
Next, check your e-mail address.

00:00:28.548 --> 00:00:31.456
It shows Confirmed once you've
opened the link we sent you.

00:00:32.563 --> 00:00:35.363
If it says Not confirmed, open that link,

00:00:35.413 --> 00:00:38.692
or click Resend verification
e-mail to get a new one.

00:00:39.692 --> 00:00:43.342
Then, under Sign-in methods,
click Link Google account,

00:00:43.392 --> 00:00:46.060
and choose the Google account
you want to sign in with.

00:00:47.086 --> 00:00:51.336
If it uses the same e-mail,
linking also confirms your address.

00:00:51.386 --> 00:00:55.882
After that, you can sign in with Google,
or with your e-mail and password.

00:00:56.846 --> 00:01:00.946
To change your password, type your
current password, then the new one twice,

00:01:00.996 --> 00:01:02.613
and click Change password.

00:01:03.842 --> 00:01:08.367
Under Companies, you see every company
you belong to, and your role in each.

00:01:08.417 --> 00:01:09.890
Click one to open it.

00:01:10.887 --> 00:01:13.773
And when you're done on a
shared computer, click Sign out.

00:01:15.369 --> 00:01:19.694
Now your name, e-mail, password
and Google sign-in are up to date,

00:01:19.744 --> 00:01:22.135
and you can sign in the
way that suits you best.

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:27.510
So, change your name, confirm your
e-mail, link Google, change your password,

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:28.835
and see your companies.

00:01:30.129 --> 00:01:34.299
Your account, your way. Next, invite
your client into their portal,

00:01:34.349 --> 00:01:36.556
in tutorial 11.11.
